118
00:11:44,225 --> 00:11:46,185
You fucking dumbass!

119
00:11:46,268 --> 00:11:47,102
Got it?

120
00:11:50,272 --> 00:11:54,109
How can people like us live
without creating new characters?

121
00:11:55,110 --> 00:11:56,862
When you buried Dong-seok, shit,

122
00:11:57,363 --> 00:11:58,989
