126
00:12:12,002 --> 00:12:13,295
Fuck.

127
00:12:23,514 --> 00:12:25,349
I have to get another one. Fuck.

128
00:12:30,354 --> 00:12:33,941
Min-yeong, you, and I used this room
last time we were on board, right?

129
