156
00:15:26,321 --> 00:15:27,156
That detective.

157
00:15:34,413 --> 00:15:35,914
What's this?

158
00:15:41,879 --> 00:15:43,797
You were a fake from birth.

159
00:15:45,340 --> 00:15:47,217
When you were born, he was sent away.

160
00:15:49,386 --> 00:15:50,596
You took his place.

161
00:15:52,097 --> 00:15:54,516
I brought him in to catch you.

162
