Yes.

167
00:16:21,919 --> 00:16:23,212
Even Min-yeong.

168
00:16:25,297 --> 00:16:26,173
Huh?

169
00:16:29,968 --> 00:16:32,387
Did you guys see the post?
That's So Min-yeong.

170
00:16:32,471 --> 00:16:34,556
-You're right.
-It's her, right?

171
00:16:35,182 --> 00:16:37,142
She's got some nerve showing up here.

172
00:16:37,226 --> 00:16:38,894
