177
00:16:47,611 --> 00:16:49,279
ANONYMOUS FORUM
LOATHSOME RATS 1

178
00:16:49,363 --> 00:16:51,532
THE SOUND OF THEIR BREATHING
COMING FROM THEIR ROOM…

179
00:16:51,615 --> 00:16:53,617
With all the rumors going around school,

180
00:16:53,700 --> 00:16:55,744
Min-yeong had to give up on grad school.

181
00:16:59,873 --> 00:17:03,919
You must've been one hell of a writer.
Even the cops had nothing on you.

182
00:17:04,586 --> 00:17:07,256
The person who wrote that dirty post
is Moon-jae.

183
00:17:07,339 --> 00:17:10,467
I wanted to beat you to death,
but I had no idea where you were.

184
00:17:10,551 --> 00:17:13,178
Everybody knows it's about us!

185
00:17:14,638 --> 00:17:18,058
After that, Min-yeong dropped out
and cut ties with her family.

186
00:17:19,893 --> 00:17:22,980
She became a wreck
who couldn't sleep without sleeping pills.

187
00:17:25,149 --> 00:17:27,651
Then she tried to kill herself
with sleeping pills.

188
00:17:29,736 --> 00:17:31,071
There was nothing I could do.

189
00:17:32,364 --> 00:17:33,991
I didn't even have any money.

190
00:17:35,534 --> 00:17:37,953
But I had to save her. She was dying.

191
00:17:46,378 --> 00:17:49,673
So I took my writing to a publisher,
hoping to sell it, and found out.

192
00:17:56,054 --> 00:17:57,514
INTERVIEW
BY SUNG HAG-YUN

193
00:18:00,976 --> 00:18:04,104
My novel had already been published
and won the Best New Writer award.

194
00:18:04,188 --> 00:18:05,189
INTERVIEW

195
00:18:09,776 --> 00:18:13,155
You took my life, my future,

196
00:18:13,906 --> 00:18:15,991
everything from me.

197
00:18:18,285 --> 00:18:20,037
Even Min-yeong.

198
00:18:32,925 --> 00:18:35,177
I wanted to tell her so badly.

199
00:18:36,136 --> 00:18:39,139
I wanted to tell her
I'd finally found that bastard.

200
00:18:41,141 --> 00:18:43,393
But there's no one left to listen.

201
00:18:57,324 --> 00:18:59,785
Min-yeong.

202
00:19:01,954 --> 00:19:02,955
Min-yeong.

203
00:19:06,166 --> 00:19:07,334
Min-yeong.

204
00:19:08,377 --> 00:19:09,419
Min-yeong.

205
00:19:10,837 --> 00:19:11,672
Min-yeong.

206
00:19:14,258 --> 00:19:15,300
Min-yeong.

207
00:19:20,472 --> 00:19:23,517
I stayed by Min-yeong's side all night,
thinking of only one thing.

208
00:19:25,602 --> 00:19:27,271
"How should I pay this back?"

209
00:19:34,278 --> 00:19:37,489
Night after night, I read your novels
beside Min-yeong's body.

210
00:19:37,990 --> 00:19:39,199
From beginning to end.

211
00:19:40,367 --> 00:19:42,035
Without missing a single word.

212
00:19:44,621 --> 00:19:45,956
You took everything.

213
00:19:46,540 --> 00:19:50,252
You became me,
and Min-yeong became your girlfriend.

214
00:19:50,752 --> 00:19:54,715
You were so jealous of me that,
in your novel,

215
00:19:55,507 --> 00:19:58,135
you subtly made yourself me and me you.

216
00:19:59,344 --> 00:20:01,596
So I decided.

217
00:20:04,850 --> 00:20:06,184
I'll get my revenge.

218
00:20:07,728 --> 00:20:09,146
I'll become you too

219
00:20:09,646 --> 00:20:12,149
and take back everything you took from me.

220
00:20:13,942 --> 00:20:16,278
I'll rip that mask off your face,

221
00:20:16,361 --> 00:20:18,488
