and throw you out.

222
00:20:19,990 --> 00:20:21,158
Satisfied now?

223
00:20:21,658 --> 00:20:25,579
Does that answer your question?
Why I became a monster?

224
00:20:28,874 --> 00:20:30,625
Welcome.

225
00:20:42,971 --> 00:20:47,893
An antiseptic, bandages,
a hemostatic agent, and painkillers.

226
00:20:47,976 --> 00:20:48,894
Hang on.

227
00:20:48,977 --> 00:20:52,439
Sir, shouldn't you go to the hospital?

228
00:20:55,317 --> 00:20:56,193
I'll

229
00:20:57,277 --> 00:20:58,612
handle it myself.

230
00:21:03,742 --> 00:21:04,785
Moon-jae

231
