just wrote that.

254
00:22:20,110 --> 00:22:21,319
I was high on drugs.

255
00:22:21,403 --> 00:22:25,157
Hey, who'd read that bullshit?
I just wrote it like a novel.

256
00:22:26,533 --> 00:22:28,660
That's why Min-yeong killed herself?

257
00:22:34,207 --> 00:22:35,834
What about the woman you killed?

258
00:22:35,917 --> 00:22:37,002
Someone else.

259
00:22:38,336 --> 00:22:40,714
You know that thug?
The one who does identity fraud?

260
00:22:41,548 --> 00:22:43,383
