261
00:22:48,472 --> 00:22:49,347
Why?

262
00:22:51,224 --> 00:22:52,809
To frame me?

263
00:22:53,935 --> 00:22:54,769
Yeah.

264
00:22:56,521 --> 00:22:58,607
You crazy bastard. You fucking nutjob!

265
00:22:58,690 --> 00:23:01,902
